text = "This divine law, straight out of Grichka Bogdanoff’s mouth, devours the red stars and drinks the sky of the Red Sea.
And like a filler episode of Naruto, the disappointing story of the purple lion continues without Leo opening his black mouth.

The world wants to read the maps of water’s memory, the girls want to poop in a hotel, and I want to kill myself!"
